 uh victor de leon uh he who  philosophy  philosophizes behind the rose  uh kind of an interesting little quip  there  you know um tying in with the other ones  and now we get into some of the the  funnier  ones that are that are not particularly  puns  but they're they're pretty good uh  jeremy says the face you make when you  realize  life did not give you lemons but  presumably he gave you corn  instead uh yeah and you know you can  tell i'm smiling there i enjoy  being out there um juan's as i want to  believe  you know if you don't know what that's a  reference to  [Music]  google the x-files and they spent quite  a bit of time  out in places like that  uh in in the show and mulder  might have been from like a country  background i don't quite remember  here's one playing off of all those  lousy t-shirts things i left wisconsin  and all i got was this  stupid corn field i mean obviously you  could get corn fields here  in wisconsin but they wouldn't be  growing quite as high most likely  and then finally last and least this is  a great one by austin  when your mom makes you take that  obligatory photo at the county fair  shortly before abandoning you in the  corn maze  so she can get smashed on three dollar  hard  ciders yeah i mean i'll tell you what  that that area of indiana newton county  you ought to go to the newton county  fair and you will see some people like  that  there the fair brings out all the people  who you don't ordinarily  cross paths with and  you know corn mazes are a big thing down  there not just for the fair  but for halloween and all sorts of other  time of the year sort of sort of things  as well so that's a that's a good joke  i'll be doing more of these caption  contests in the future so if you want to  get in  on them uh just you know stay tuned if  you're not if you don't have the  little bell thing clicked on my channel  you might want to do that so that you  get notifications  of it and you can get in on these  contests  so that'